summary:
  A button over the cover that disappears while it has the focus keeps it.

history:
  Someone walks to the cover's button with Tab and the next picture is a
  small logo: the button goes. It kept the focus, unseen, and took the next
  Space without doing anything with it. A button that goes hands the focus
  to the face. This mutant lets it keep it.

target:
  package/contents/ui/CoverTouch.qml

find:
          if (!button.visible && button.activeFocus) _toFace(button)

replace:
          if (!button.visible && !button.activeFocus) _toFace(button)

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_covertouch.qml::test_a_button_that_goes_while_it_holds_the_keyboard_lets_it_go.
  Line-neutral.
